
;Noel Snape / Holly Bradley / ULSA 2015 - 2016
;Fountains Fell Bench Survey

*cs out OSGB:SD
*cs OSGB:SD

*begin fountainsfell


*include ffgps
*include GinglingHole/Gingling
*include ElectionHole/Election
*include HammerPot/hammer
*include FOULPot/FOULPot
*include NewPastureCave/newpasture
*include MasterCave/master_cave
*include MasterCave/FAKE_gingling_sump  ;temp file with roughly estiamted sump
*INCLUDE DaleHeadPot/DaleHeadPot_reconstruction
*INCLUDE EchoPot/EchoPot_reconstruction

*equate Election.Election1.S1	ffgps.0004
*equate FOULPot.FOUL1.tag ffgps.213 

;below equations assume survey station 'gingling_sump_tube.6' is downstream end of gingling hole sump
*equate gingling_hole_master_cave.gingling_sump_tube.6 FAKE_gingling_sump.2
*equate Gingling.Gingling5.8c FAKE_gingling_sump.1  ;8c used as is splay down to water level from station at dive-line


;*equate Gingling.Gingling1.tag	ffgps.214  ;now "fixed" in Gingling main survex file
;*equate HammerPot.hammerentrance.0 ffgps.217 ;now "fixed" in Hammer main survex file
;*equate NewPastureCave.newpastureentrance.0 ffgps.211 ;now "fixed" in New Pasture main survex file


*EQUATE DaleHeadPot_reconstruction.entrance ffgps.DH1
*EQUATE EchoPot_reconstruction.entrance ffgps.212



*end  fountainsfell